sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Operator
    participant LA as Launcher
    participant DR as Spark driver
    participant EX as Executors
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    OP->>LA: run stage script
    Note over LA: package code
    LA->>DR: spark-submit
    DR->>PG: init schema, lock
    loop until no pending work
        DR->>PG: read pending rows
        DR->>EX: send tasks
        EX-->>DR: return results
        DR->>PG: commit results
    end
